            <title>[IGNITE-10764] MVCC: Transactions failed to acquire lock within timeout</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10764</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Some tests failed sporadically due to a transaction timeout though they update unique keys and deadlocks are not expected. It should be investigated.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducers:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;CacheMvccPartitionedSqlTxQueriesTest.testQueryInsertMultithread&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;CacheMvccReplicatedSqlTxQueriesTest.testQueryInsertMultithread&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
