                            <comment id="16750048" author="pavlukhin" created="Wed, 23 Jan 2019 14:29:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Increasing timeout for a single transaction might fix mentioned test. Decreasing tx timeout allows to reproduce the issue easily. Exception message &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Failed to acquire lock within provided timeout for transaction&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;looks misleading.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16752116" author="pavlukhin" created="Fri, 25 Jan 2019 10:11:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC run of the suite containing the problematic test &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2893878&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_MvccQueries&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F5910%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2893878&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_MvccQueries&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F5910%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16754093" author="rkondakov" created="Mon, 28 Jan 2019 16:04:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Pavlukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Pavlukhin&quot;&gt;Pavlukhin&lt;/a&gt;, could you please clarify the reason of the test failures? Is it caused by the big size of the transaction and small timeout? And on some weak agents transactions were were not able to acquire all needed locks within timeout? And there is no any other reason why are locks are not acquired in time, right?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16754777" author="pavlukhin" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 09:22:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt; Yes you described the thing pretty well.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
